      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0001",
      "source": "In a mutable composition, the tracks are instances of [`AVMutableCompositionTrack`](avmutablecompositiontrack.md), whereas in [`AVComposition`](avcomposition.md) the tracks are instances of [`AVCompositionTrack`](avcompositiontrack.md).",
      "ko": "변경 가능한 컴포지션에서는 tracks가 [`AVMutableCompositionTrack`](avmutablecompositiontrack.md)의 인스턴스이며, [`AVComposition`](avcomposition.md)에서는 tracks가 [`AVCompositionTrack`](avcompositiontrack.md)의 인스턴스입니다.",
      "sourceHash": "d2d4e60f6570f6283912e8f381c8f4281c5191b018fb69e1ffc39ddb7d5704f6",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
